{"seq":4,"slug":"responsible-ai","title":"负责任AI","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/responsible-ai","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-transparency","title":"AI 透明性与可解释性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/responsible-ai/ai-transparency","wordCount":1170,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-accountability","title":"AI 问责机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/responsible-ai/ai-accountability","wordCount":971,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-governance-framework","title":"AI 治理框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/responsible-ai/ai-governance-framework","wordCount":1709,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"explainable-ai","title":"可解释 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/responsible-ai/explainable-ai","wordCount":1252,"readingTime":6},{"seq":5,"slug":"ai-safety-alignment","title":"AI 安全与对齐基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/responsible-ai/ai-safety-alignment","wordCount":1496,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"负责任ai-简介\">负责任AI 简介</h1><p>本章从AI系统的角度探讨如何构建负责任的人工智能。随着AI在高风险领域的广泛应用，确保AI系统的透明性、可问责性和可治理性已成为行业共识和监管要求。</p>\n<p><strong>AI透明性</strong>介绍AI系统透明性的多个维度，包括模型可解释性、决策过程的可审计性和面向用户的透明沟通，探讨不同场景下的透明性要求和实现方法。</p>\n<p><strong>AI问责制</strong>讲解AI系统的问责框架设计，涵盖责任分配、影响评估、事故响应和持续监控等环节，帮助组织建立完善的AI问责机制。</p>\n<p><strong>AI治理框架</strong>探讨组织级AI治理体系的构建方法，包括治理组织架构、政策制定、风险管理和合规审查等核心要素。</p>\n<p>建议读者将本章作为前三章知识的综合提升，从系统层面思考如何构建负责任的AI实践体系。</p>\n"}